msgid "Administrative Documentation"
msgstr "Dokimantasyon Administratif"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Akèy"

msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Dokimantasyon"

msgid "Bookmarklets"
msgstr "Ti zouti makè"

msgid "Documentation bookmarklets"
msgstr "Dokimantasyon ti zouti makè yo"

msgid ""
"To install bookmarklets, drag the link to your bookmarks toolbar, or right-"
"click the link and add it to your bookmarks. Now you can select the "
"bookmarklet from any page in the site."
msgstr ""
"Pou enstale ti zouti makè yo, trennen lyen an nan ba zouti makè ou, oswa fè "
"yon klik-dwat sou lyen an epi ajoute l nan makè ou. Kounye a ou ka chwazi ti "
"zouti makè a depi nenpòt paj nan sit la."

msgid "Documentation for this page"
msgstr "Dokimantasyon pou paj sa a"

msgid ""
"Jumps you from any page to the documentation for the view that generates "
"that page."
msgstr ""
"Menm si w sou nenpòt paj, sa ap mennen w nan dokimantasyon pou \"View\" ki "
"jenere paj sa a."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Etikèt"

msgid "List of all the template tags and their functions."
msgstr "Lis tout tag \"template\" ak fonksyon yo."

msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filtè"

msgid ""
"Filters are actions which can be applied to variables in a template to alter "
"the output."
msgstr ""
"Filtè yo se aksyon ou ka aplike sou varyab nan yon \"template\" pou chanje "
"rezilta a."

msgid "Models"
msgstr "Modèl yo"

msgid ""
"Models are descriptions of all the objects in the system and their "
"associated fields. Each model has a list of fields which can be accessed as "
"template variables"
msgstr ""
"Modèl yo se deskripsyon tout objè ki nan sistèm nan ak chan ki asosye ak yo. "
"Chak modèl gen yon lis chan ki ka itilize kòm varyab nan \"template\"."

msgid "Views"
msgstr "Afiche"

msgid ""
"Each page on the public site is generated by a view. The view defines which "
"template is used to generate the page and which objects are available to "
"that template."
msgstr ""
"Chak paj sou sit piblik la fèt pa yon \"View\". View a defini ki "
"\"template\" itilize pou kreye paj la ak ki objè ki disponib pou modèl sa a."

msgid "Tools for your browser to quickly access admin functionality."
msgstr ""
"Zouti pou navigatè ou a pou jwenn rapid aksè ak fonksyonalite admin lan."

msgid "Please install docutils"
msgstr "Tanpri enstale docutils"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The admin documentation system requires Python’s <a "
"href=\"%(link)s\">docutils</a> library."
msgstr ""
"Sistèm dokimantasyon admin nan bezwen bibliyotèk Python <a "
"href=\"%(link)s\">docutils</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Please ask your administrators to install <a href=\"%(link)s\">docutils</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tanpri mande administratè ou yo pou enstale <a href=\"%(link)s\">docutils</"
"a>."

#, python-format
msgid "Model: %(name)s"
msgstr "Modèl: %(name)s"

msgid "Fields"
msgstr "Chan yo"

msgid "Field"
msgstr "Chan"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "Tip"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "Deskripsyon"

msgid "Methods with arguments"
msgstr "Metòd ak agiman"

msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metòd"

msgid "Arguments"
msgstr "Agiman"

msgid "Back to Model documentation"
msgstr "Retounen nan modèl dokimantassyon an"

msgid "Model documentation"
msgstr "Modèl dokimantasyon"

msgid "Model groups"
msgstr "Modèl gwoup yo"

msgid "Templates"
msgstr "templates"

#, python-format
msgid "Template: %(name)s"
msgstr "template: %(name)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Template: <q>%(name)s</q>"
msgstr "Modèl paj yo: <q> %(name)s </q>"

#. Translators: Search is not a verb here, it qualifies path (a search path)
#, python-format
msgid "Search path for template <q>%(name)s</q>:"
msgstr "Chache chemen pou modèl paj yo <q>%(name)s</q>:"

msgid "(does not exist)"
msgstr "(pa egziste)"

msgid "Back to Documentation"
msgstr "Retounen nan dokimantasyon an"

msgid "Template filters"
msgstr "Filtre \"template\" yo"

msgid "Template filter documentation"
msgstr "Filtre template dokimantasyon an"

msgid "Built-in filters"
msgstr "Filtre ki entegre"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"To use these filters, put <code>%(code)s</code> in your template before "
"using the filter."
msgstr ""
"Pou sèvi ak filtè sa yo, mete <code>%(code)s</code> nan template ou an anvan "
"ou itilize l."

msgid "Template tags"
msgstr "Etikèt template yo"

msgid "Template tag documentation"
msgstr "Dokimantasyon etikèt template la"

msgid "Built-in tags"
msgstr "Etikèt ki entegre"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"To use these tags, put <code>%(code)s</code> in your template before using "
"the tag."
msgstr ""
"Pou itilize tag sa yo, mete <code>%(code)s</code> nan modèl paj yo ou an "
"anvan ou itilize tag la."

#, python-format
msgid "View: %(name)s"
msgstr "Afiche: %(name)s"

msgid "Context:"
msgstr "Kontèks :"

msgid "Templates:"
msgstr "Templates:"

msgid "Back to View documentation"
msgstr "Retounen nan dokimantasyon \"View\" yo"

msgid "View documentation"
msgstr "Gade dokimantasyon an"

msgid "Jump to namespace"
msgstr "Ale dirèk nan \"namespace\" la"

msgid "Empty namespace"
msgstr " \"Namespace\" vid"

#, python-format
msgid "Views by namespace %(name)s"
msgstr "\"Views\" yo nan \"namespace\" %(name)s"

msgid "Views by empty namespace"
msgstr "\"views\" yo nan namespace lan vid"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    View function: <code>%(full_name)s</code>. Name: <code>%(url_name)s</"
"code>.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Fonksyon \"views\" yo:<code>%(full_name)s</code>. Non: <code>%(url_name)s</"
"code>.\n"

msgid "tag:"
msgstr "etikèt:"

msgid "filter:"
msgstr "filtre"

msgid "view:"
msgstr "gade:"

#, python-format
msgid "App %(app_label)r not found"
msgstr "App %(app_label)r pa retrouve"

#, python-format
msgid "Model %(model_name)r not found in app %(app_label)r"
msgstr "Modèl %(model_name)r pa retrouve l nan app %(app_label)r"

msgid "model:"
msgstr "modèl:"

#, python-format
msgid "the related `%(app_label)s.%(data_type)s` object"
msgstr "objè ki gen rapò ak `%(app_label)s.%(data_type)s` "

#, python-format
msgid "related `%(app_label)s.%(object_name)s` objects"
msgstr "objè `%(app_label)s.%(object_name)s` ki gen rapò"

#, python-format
msgid "all %s"
msgstr "tout %s"

#, python-format
msgid "number of %s"
msgstr "kantite %s"

#, python-format
msgid "%s does not appear to be a urlpattern object"
msgstr "%s pa sanble ak yon objè urlpattern"
